# Git worktrees checked out inside the repo. Untracked-but-not-ignored, poly
# walks them and reports the worktree's own copies of files as failures, so a
# single worktree turns `poly fmt --check .` red for reasons unrelated to the
# tree being checked. ~keep
.worktrees/

